# ============================================================================
# MALARIA PROJECT .gitignore
# ============================================================================
#
# REPOSITORY POLICY (Updated July 2026):
# 1. Manuscripts: Full content of every manuscript/ folder is committed,
#    including .tex, graphics (.pdf/.png/.jpg/.eps), .bib, etc.  Only
#    LaTeX auxiliary files (see the LaTeX section below) are excluded.
# 2. Data & Results: All data/ and results/ subdirectories are committed.
#    Only genuinely heavy files (MD trajectories, docking poses, model
#    weights, large logs, archives, temporary build files) are excluded.
# ============================================================================

# ============================================================================
# Python & Development
# ============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
pip-wheel-metadata/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

